DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_EAB5_4B0B';
<p>eab5_4b0b</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene K</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene M</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>mushy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene M</span> feels soft to the touch and unusually squishy, unlike the usual firmness.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #9a3064;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, mushy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">14,192</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">606</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">64,717</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">35,522</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">35,629</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">64,600</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">555</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">14,179</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">230,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>M</b> and <b>P</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>M</b> and <b>P</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_EAB5_4B0B
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(14,179 + 14,192 + 35,522 + 35,629)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>99,522</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.4327 = <strong>43.27 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(555 + 606 + 14,179 + 14,192)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>29,532</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.1284 = <strong>12.84 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(555 + 606 + 35,522 + 35,629)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>72,312</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.3144 = <strong>31.44 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(606 + 14,179 + 14,192 + 64,717)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>93,694</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.4074 = <strong>40.74 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(606 + 14,192 + 35,629 + 64,717)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>115,144</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.5006 = <strong>50.06 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(64,600 + 64,717)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>129,317</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.5622 = <strong>56.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(14,179 + 14,192 + 35,522 + 35,629)</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = <sup>99,522</sup>/<sub>230,000</sub> = 0.4327 = <strong>43.27 cM</strong>
LITERAL_EAB5_4B0B_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
